    {
      "id": "shared-contracts",
      "status": "AMBER",
      "finding": "All seven project READMEs and supporting standards refer to Observation, WorldState, ActionProposal and FailureReport. A single canonical versioned implementation consumed by all projects was not verified. The Robot Car contracts.py describes itself as temporary/local."
    },
    {
      "id": "ruleset-review",
      "status": "AMBER",
      "finding": "All seven repositories have at least one active ruleset. One representative active ruleset per repository was inspected; each requires a pull request and prevents non-fast-forward updates, but each sampled configuration requires zero approving reviews and no code-owner review or review-thread resolution."
    },
    {
      "id": "ruleset-overlap",
      "status": "AMBER",
      "finding": "25 rulesets total: 24 active and one disabled. Coconut, Flood and Screening each have seven. Review every ruleset's conditions and effects before consolidation."
    },
    {
      "id": "branch-protection-api",
      "status": "GREY",
      "finding": "The classic branch-protection endpoint returned HTTP 403 for all seven repositories. Classic protection and required status checks could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-inventory",
      "status": "GREEN",
      "finding": "97 workflow files were listed across seven repositories. A PUI89 security-audit workflow is present in each repository. Flood and Screening also expose CodeQL and dependency-review workflow files."
    },
